# T_SCRE: item 5, the host of item 19 in use with it: its form says so
# beside its quantity and the unit on loan; Loans and holds opens its
# Loans tab, Ctrl-PgDn the rows used with it, Open item there shows item
# 19's form, Esc comes back; Ins adds a reservation of item 23 for it,
# the host preset; Return or release releases item 19's use; Ctrl-PgDn
# back to its own rows, Return or release returns its loan.
# Its status set to D is then refused while item 23 is reserved for it.
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S ITEM5
K ALT-C A CPGDN
S HOSTROWS
K ALT-C I
S ITEM19
K ESC ALT-C A CPGDN INS ENTER
T 23
K ENTER
S PRESET
K TAB
T Club show
K CTRL-S
S ADDED
K HOME ALT-C R ENTER
S RELEASED
K CPGDN HOME ALT-C R ENTER
S RETURNED
K ESC
S HELD
K CTRL-E TAB SPACE CTRL-S
S REFUSED
K ESC
T Y
K ESC
